[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13380.91, "timestamp": "03:43:00", "text": "對我來說就足夠了。我對[音樂]廣告並沒有特別高的看法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13401.11, "timestamp": "03:43:21", "text": "一下。不，我剛剛不是點了一個完全虛構的選項？哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13405.15, "timestamp": "03:43:25", "text": "，不。不，啟動"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13408.75, "timestamp": "03:43:28", "text": "它。等待。呃，需要使用開源著色器套件。  好的，我這就關閉它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13414.349, "timestamp": "03:43:34", "text": "別理"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13417.349, "timestamp": "03:43:37", "text": "我。好的。把那段貼到那邊。  結束。關閉就能證明這一點。搞定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13425.91, "timestamp": "03:43:45", "text": "然後點擊。重新開放。  中等的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13429.15, "timestamp": "03:43:49", "text": "。再打開一次。中等厚度並"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13431.67, "timestamp": "03:43:51", "text": "塗抹。請不要告訴我這樣做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13432.51, "timestamp": "03:43:52", "text": "會不會太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13435.469, "timestamp": "03:43:55", "text": "苛刻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13438.63, "timestamp": "03:43:58", "text": "。好的，剛才那邊速度達到了"}]